# The Dockerfile copies data/demo/ (4 KB of sample transactions), so the
# exclusion has to name the heavy trees rather than all of data/ — excluding
# the parent made that COPY fail with "file not found" and took the whole
# image build down with it. The serving tensors arrive from the Azure Files
# mount at GRAPHSAGE_DATA_ROOT, never from the image.
